Column name: BLOCK_TIMESTAMP Type: NUMBER Description: Unix timestamp when the block was added to the blockchain.
Column name: REMOVED Type: BOOLEAN Description: Whether or not the event was orphaned off the main chain.
Column name: EVENT_SIGNATURE Type: TEXT Description: The function signature of the event.
Column name: EVENT_HASH Type: TEXT Description: Keccak hash of the event signature.
Column name: TRANSACTION_INDEX Type: NUMBER Description: The transaction's index position in the block.
Column name: ADDRESS Type: TEXT Description: Address from which this event originated.
